    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under Subsection (15) of Section 5 of the Value Added Tax Act, No. 14 of 2002, aslast amended by the Value Added Tax (Amendment) Act, No. 20 of 2016, I, Ravi Karunanayake, Minister of Finance do bythis order prescribe that the cost of the services set out in the Schedule hereto, shall be excluded in calculating the valueof supply of healthcare services for the purpose of Value Added Tax, with effect from 01.11.2016.",
